- Snippet “Hiding accidentals on tied notes at the start of a new system” (read_doc id `snippet/hiding-accidentals-on-tied-notes-at-the-start-of-a-new-system`; renders in Score Chat)

- Snippet “Preventing extra naturals from being automatically added” (read_doc id `snippet/preventing-extra-naturals-from-being-automatically-added`; renders in Score Chat)

**See also:** Music Glossary: “sharp” (Music Glossary), “flat” (Music Glossary), “double sharp” (Music Glossary), “double flat” (Music Glossary), “Pitch names” (Music Glossary), “quarter tone” (Music Glossary).

Learning Manual: “Pitches and key signatures” (Learning Manual).

