- Snippet “Beams across line breaks” (read_doc id `snippet/beams-across-line-breaks`; not supported by the Score Chat renderer)

- Snippet “Changing beam knee gap” (read_doc id `snippet/changing-beam-knee-gap`; renders in Score Chat)

- Snippet “Partcombine and autoBeamOff” (read_doc id `snippet/partcombine-and-autobeamoff`; renders in Score Chat)

