This snippet shows how to bring the lyrics line closer to the staff.

Example (renders in Score Chat):
```lilypond
\version "2.24.4"
\score {
% Default layout:
<<
  \new Staff \new Voice = melody \relative c' {
    c4 d e f
    g4 f e d
    c1
  }
  \new Lyrics \lyricsto melody { aa aa aa aa aa aa aa aa aa }

